; The Broken Circle's boss (.ai/campaign.md section 6): a standing stone of the moot, torn out of
; the heath, a split down its face and his mark in the split. It walks slowly and closes rings of
; falling stone on the player with one gap in each (NinthStoneBoss.cs). A stone does not recoil:
; knockback resistance 1, like the Still Warden. Its own slam is a small ring at its feet.
